WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.890
Welcome to Process Asset Development. In this lesson, we explore this purpose: Create and maintain reusable organizational process assets.

2
00:00:09.890 --> 00:00:20.060
Consider this scenario. Four teams independently build their own review templates. First understand the problem before producing documentation.

3
00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:30.800
Start with two steps: Discover reusable process needs. Then Develop common guidance and templates. Each step should be explained and evidenced.

4
00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:40.610
Continue with Publish and control assets. Then Collect feedback and maintain assets. Verify the results against the intended outcome.

5
00:00:40.610 --> 00:01:00.440
Stronger evidence looks like this: Stronger: contemporaneous process library, template history, tailoring guidance tied to real work. Weaker evidence would be: Weaker: inventing every process from scratch for each project; no trace of consistent use. Triangulate independent sources.

6
00:01:00.440 --> 00:01:14.690
Now your turn. Review four documents and two interviews, identify inconsistencies and complete the mastery challenge. This video is an independent teaching explanation, not official CMMI model wording.
